<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Spanjaard half year shr up, sees good H2.</title>
<headline>Spanjaard half year shr up, sees good H2.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended August 31</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     5.3	   vs 4.8</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   0.31	  vs 0.28</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   0.31	  vs 0.28</p>
<p>    Tax			 nil	   vs same</p>
<p>    Turnover		  19.07	 vs 18.13</p>
<p>Full name: Spanjaard Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - Spanjaard, a maker of lubricants, said capital expenditure had been lower than last year and that, following a traditional pattern, the second half of the financial year is expected to yield better results than the first.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
